<title>USA: GOLF-LEADING SCORES AT HAWAIIAN OPEN AFTER FIRST ROUND.</title>
<headline>GOLF-LEADING SCORES AT HAWAIIAN OPEN AFTER FIRST ROUND.</headline>
<dateline>HONOLULU, Hawaii 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scores from the $1.2 million United Hawaiian Open after the first round on Thursday at the 7,012-yard, par-72 Waialae C.C. course (players U.S. unless stated):</p>
<p>62 Mike Reid, Brian Claar</p>
<p>63 Pete Jordan</p>
<p>64 Ed Dougherty, Len Mattiace</p>
<p>65 Tom Lehman, Kelly Gibson, Jim Thorpe, Scott Simpson, Duffy</p>
<p>Waldorf</p>
<p>66 Tim Herron, Joel Edwards, Jimmy Green</p>
<p>67 Tom Byrum, Paul Azinger, John Daly, Don Pooley, Doug</p>
<p>Barron, John Dowdall, Dave Barr (Canada), Jeff Hart, Stuart</p>
<p>Appleby (Australia), J.P. Hayes</p>
<p>Additional international scores</p>
<p>70 Grant Waite (New Zealand), Nobuo Serizawa (Japan)</p>
<p>71 Phil Tataurangi (New Zealand), Naomichi &quot;Joe&quot; Ozaki</p>
<p>(Japan), Hideki Kase (Japan)</p>
<p>72 Jesper Parnevik (Sweden), Bradley Hughes (Australia),</p>
<p>Hidemichi Tanaka (Japan)</p>
<p>73 Kazuhiko Hosokawa (Japan), Hisayuki Sasaki (Japan)</p>
<p>79 Gabriel Hjerstedt (Sweden)</p>
